# Generated game assets — 82 MB of downloaded terrain, imagery and planet maps.
# Regenerate with scripts/fetch-assets.sh; that script (not this repo) is the
# record of how each one was built. The wildcards also swallow the default-output
# scratch a bare fetchcity run leaves behind (cities/city.city, city.ortho.png).
examples/games/flight/cities/*.city
examples/games/flight/cities/*.ortho.png
examples/games/apsis/bodies/*.png
# font.png is a hand-made bitmap font, not a fetched planet map — it stays.
!examples/games/apsis/bodies/font.png

